---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PlatformCards from '../components/PlatformCards.astro';
---
<Base title="Get started — Magus" description="Choose your Magus platform. Steam devices are available in alpha, the Mac source alpha is ready to build, and general Linux support is coming soon.">
  <div class="site-frame inner-page">
    <header class="page-intro"><a class="breadcrumb" href="/">Magus <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Get started</a><p class="eyebrow">A PLACE TO START</p><h1>What's your device?</h1><p class="lede">Same idea. A setup that fits your platform.<br />Steam devices and the Mac source alpha are ready to explore.</p></header>
    <PlatformCards />
    <div class="page-note"><span class="note-mark" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><h2>Prefer to pick your own commands?</h2><p>The <a href="/setup">advanced Steam Deck command picker ↗</a> lets you choose individual tools and review a script before running it.</p></div></div>
    <section class="simple-panel"><h2>Start small. Know what happens.</h2><p>Installing Magus only installs the tool. Launching it is a separate step, and the Steam guide walks you through both. This is an alpha release; read the device notes before you begin.</p><a class="text-link" href="/steam">Read the Steam installation guide ↗</a></section>
  </div>
</Base>
